drivers/net/ethernet/intel/iecm/iecm_virtchnl.c:1400:3-10: WARNING opportun=
ity for kmemdup

 Use kmemdup rather than duplicating its implementation

Generated by: scripts/coccinelle/api/memdup.cocci

Fixes: 201bc2bf6517 ("iecm: Add iecm to the kernel build system")
